{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"be0a9f9f25b8ffaf35815a07062412c6111e41a083cf8b96dee5b6bc991dd627","digest":{"component_or_area":"ticket create/edit with plan-review gate","key_entities":["verify.max_ticket_description_chars","src/rebar/_commands/gates.py::description_cap_warning","src/rebar/_commands/composer.py","src/rebar/_lib_writes.py::create_ticket","src/rebar/_lib_writes.py::edit_ticket","src/rebar/_mcp_writes.py","llm/plan_review/det_floor.py::_description_limit","CreateResultOut","WriteAckOut","tests/unit/test_description_cap_warning.py"],"problem_keywords":["description cap","save-time warning","plan review gate","config-driven threshold","early feedback"],"propositions":["Ticket descriptions exceeding the configured cap (verify.max_ticket_description_chars, default 8000) trigger a save-time warning when the plan-review claim gate is enabled, giving immediate feedback instead of blocking at review time.","The warning is emitted on all three surfaces (CLI stderr, library logger, MCP result field) after the ticket write succeeds, never blocking or altering the write.","The save-time warning reuses the same gate-enablement probe (_plan_review_gate_applies) and config key as the plan-review admission guard, ensuring a single source of truth for the cap and gate logic.","No warning is emitted when the gate is disabled, the description is within the cap, or the ticket type is exempt from the gate."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787363885784064001,"uuid":"e37d2484-899a-48a3-bb96-9a0d96352fd5"}